 location="Arises from the distal basilar in the interpeduncular cistern, passes laterally below the oculomotor nerve (which separates it from the posterior cerebral artery), runs around the cerebral peduncle in the ambient cistern under the free edge of the tentorium, and fans out over the superior cerebellar surface.",
